    "disabled": false,
    "info": "Turns something on in the 4 cheapest hours of the next 24 hours (published prices only) and off otherwise.\n\nThe cheapest node sends by itself a few seconds after every full hour, but only when 'cheap now' changes. The inject node asks once at deploy so the state is right straight away. Replace the debug node with your relay, smart plug or MQTT publish."
